{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年50歲的內地女星趙薇曾經憑經典劇集《還珠格格》「小燕子」一角，紅遍兩岸三地，可惜自2021年傳被列為「劣迹藝人」疑遭封殺後，已鮮有在幕前甚至大眾視野上出現。</p><p>近日趙薇罕有出席國際級髮型師Kim Robinson在新加坡舉行的活動。</p><p>期間趙薇</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:46.152690+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.308870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:14.308870+00:00","content_hash":"c2377800c41efd8758f99cb3226d1c1a17d6fa2992b30949e9c442574e7ed300","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}